    {
      "id": "main_b_matrix_text", "type": "text", "x": 320, "y": 1195, "width": 810, "height": 435,
      "text": "SPEC                         REQ   ARCH   IMPL   VALID\n\nBilling anomaly alerts       ✅    ✅     4/6    2/4\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nAuthentication repair        ✅    ✅     3/3    5/6\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSlack scheduled reports      ✅    2/3    —      —\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nDocumentation refresh        N/A   N/A    2/2    ✅\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nGitOps credential repair     ✅    ✅     2/2    ✅\n\nSelected cell remains highlighted.\nClose drawer with ✕ or Esc to return to full-width matrix.",
