    {
      "id": "interaction_text_3", "type": "text", "x": 1855, "y": 478, "width": 735, "height": 80,
      "text": "Filters and saved views\nFilter by phase, risk, owner, blocked state, or text. Saved views store display preferences;\nURL/query state makes them shareable. Nothing changes lifecycle state.",
