    {
      "id": "interaction_text_6", "type": "text", "x": 1855, "y": 813, "width": 735, "height": 82,
      "text": "Requirement link\nOpens Traceability: requirement → architecture decision → stories → tests/gates → commits\n→ staging/production evidence. Unmapped requirements become readiness blockers.",
