    {
      "id": "interaction_text_9", "type": "text", "x": 1855, "y": 1168, "width": 735, "height": 96,
      "text": "Review override\nOpens a policy packet—not an immediate waiver. It shows the rule, missing evidence, risk,\napprovers, scope and expiry. Hard safety controls remain non-bypassable.",
      "originalText": "Review override\nOpens a policy packet—not an immediate waiver. It shows the rule, missing evidence, risk,\napprovers, scope and expiry. Hard safety controls remain non-bypassable.",
