    },
    {
      "id": "invariants_text", "type": "text", "x": 1815, "y": 1690, "width": 770, "height": 112,
      "text": "• Every phase is required, deferred with approval, or N/A with rationale.\n• Requirements must map to stories or gates; required gates must map to evidence.\n• Material PRD/SDD changes recompile the plan and invalidate affected downstream approvals.\n• QA, merge and production verify the same immutable commit/image.\n• Only validated contracts advance state—never an agent's completion claim alone.",
      "originalText": "• Every phase is required, deferred with approval, or N/A with rationale.\n• Requirements must map to stories or gates; required gates must map to evidence.\n• Material PRD/SDD changes recompile the plan and invalidate affected downstream approvals.\n• QA, merge and production verify the same immutable commit/image.\n• Only validated contracts advance state—never an agent's completion claim alone.",
      "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "seed": 400069,
      "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400070, "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
